{%- doc -%}
  Kit PDP system: what the kit's contents cost bought one by one, in öre.

  = snippets/nr-kit-separate-total (current price of every referenced
    component variant × quantity; never compare-at)
  − custom.kit_separate_adjust (kr, optional): an ACTIVE automatic discount
    that lowers the one-by-one price of the same products (e.g. "revolt +
    mikrofiber" on the wheel kits), so the saving is never overstated.

  The only place the separate value is calculated – hero, value section and
  any other caller capture this snippet. Outputs 0 when components are missing.

  @param {product} product - The kit product.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  capture separate_total
    render 'nr-kit-separate-total', product: product
  endcapture
  assign separate_total = separate_total | strip | plus: 0
  assign adjust = product.metafields.custom.kit_separate_adjust.value
  if separate_total > 0 and adjust != blank
    assign adjust_ore = adjust | times: 100 | round
    assign separate_total = separate_total | minus: adjust_ore
  endif
  echo separate_total
-%}
